{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And they shall clear the ashes off the altar.</b> The bronze altar." "<b>And they shall clear.</b> They shall remove the ashes from upon it." "<b>And they shall spread over it a purple cloth.</b> And the fire that descended from heaven lay crouched beneath the cloth like a lion at the time of the journeys, and did not burn it — for they would spread over it a copper cover (Yoma 21)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:20.845172151Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}